{%- comment -%}
	cart-upsell-box — the row the cart drawer's offers share: the refill
	upsell and the second kit offer. No box since the spacing brief of
	22 Oct: it sits like another line row, edge to edge with the same
	hairline above it as between the kit and the pouch. Hidden until the
	drawer script shows it; one offer shows at a time. The eyebrow keeps its
	letter-spacing for Latin text only (hard rule 10: none on Arabic).
	Params:
	  attrs         the data attribute the script finds the box by (required)
	  eyebrow       small highlighted line above the row (optional)
	  body          captured markup for the row: the text, after a thumbnail link when the offer shows one
	  button_label  the Add button's label
	  button_attrs  raw attributes for the button (data-*)
{%- endcomment -%}
<div {{ attrs }} class="hidden -mx-6 px-6 py-3 md:py-4 border-t border-bg-muted">
	{%- if eyebrow != blank -%}
		<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rtl:tracking-normal text-highlight">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
	{%- endif -%}
	<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
		{{ body }}
		{%- render 'cta-button',
			label: button_label,
			variant: 'outline',
			size: 'sm',
			element: 'button',
			attributes: button_attrs,
			extra_classes: 'shrink-0'
		-%}
	</div>
</div>
